{"Title":"An Act creating the Manuel F. Correllus State Forest Trust Fund","BillNumber":"H4094","DocketNumber":"HD4365","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"PrimarySponsor":{"Id":"DAF1","Name":"Dylan A. Fernandes","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DAF1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-23T19:21:28.477"},"Cosponsors":[{"Id":"DAF1","Name":"Dylan A. Fernandes","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/DAF1","ResponseDate":"2023-04-23T19:21:28.4766667"},{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2023-08-23T16:31:01.24"}],"JointSponsor":{"Id":"JAC0","Name":"Julian Cyr","Type":1,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/LegislativeMembers/JAC0","ResponseDate":"2023-05-25T15:37:33.997"},"BillHistory":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Documents/H4094/DocumentHistoryActions","LegislationTypeName":"Bill","Pinslip":"By Representative Fernandes of Falmouth and Senator Cyr, a joint petition (subject to Joint Rule 12) of Dylan A. Fernandes and Julian Cyr for legislation to authorize the establishment of the Manuel F. Correllus State Forest trust fund.  Environment and Natural Resources.","DocumentText":"\tChapter 92 of the General Laws are hereby amended by inserting after section 34D the following section:- \r\n\t“Section 34E: Notwithstanding any general or special law or administrative bulletin to the contrary and pursuant to section 34, there is hereby established and set up on the books of the commonwealth a separate fund, to be known as the Manuel F. Correllus State Forest Trust Fund, which shall be used for the purposes of advancing recreational, educational and conservation interests, including, but not limited to, the construction and maintenance of facilities and infrastructure improvements for the area within the forest complex. The trust shall receive, hold and expend all fees generated by permits, licenses, easements, and all other agreements not currently being directed to the General Fund relating to the use of the forest complex land as authorized by the commission. The department shall not make expenditures from this fund so as to cause the fund to be deficient.”\r\n","EmergencyPreamble":null,"RollCalls":[],"Attachments":[],"CommitteeRecommendations":[{"Action":"Suspend Rules","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"H33","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/H33"},"Votes":[]},{"Action":"Favorable","FiscalAmounts":[],"Committee":{"CommitteeCode":"J21","GeneralCourtNumber":193,"Details":"https://malegislature.gov/api/GeneralCourts/193/Committees/J21"},"Votes":[]}],"Amendments":[]}